            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Remasted with VIVE support!</h1><p>I remastered the original game and am adding HTC VIVE support!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>FULL HTC VIVE SUPPORT COMING SOON!!!!!\r\n\r\n****May 2017 update****\r\nI have been re-mastering the old DK2 version of this game and am currently adding HTC VIVE support. I am adding a few videos of some progress, just see above. ****\r\n\r\nVirtual Insanity is a first person psychological horror game and was created from the ground up for VR.\r\nEnter a nightmare where you will lose your sense of reality. Have you lost your mind? Or has the world around you gone mad?\r\n\r\nThis is a single-player game. \r\n\r\nBuilt from the ground up for the VR. \r\nI started creating this game in October of 2015. This is my first full game and 3rd Unity project, I spent 7 months working on the current release, but have been remastering it for VIVE/room-scale ever since, by myself, and started it with less than a year of Unity and game design experience.",
            "about_the_game": "FULL HTC VIVE SUPPORT COMING SOON!!!!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n****May 2017 update****<br />\r\nI have been re-mastering the old DK2 version of this game and am currently adding HTC VIVE support. I am adding a few videos of some progress, just see above. ****<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVirtual Insanity is a first person psychological horror game and was created from the ground up for VR.<br />\r\nEnter a nightmare where you will lose your sense of reality. Have you lost your mind? Or has the world around you gone mad?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a single-player game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuilt from the ground up for the VR. <br />\r\nI started creating this game in October of 2015. This is my first full game and 3rd Unity project, I spent 7 months working on the current release, but have been remastering it for VIVE/room-scale ever since, by myself, and started it with less than a year of Unity and game design experience.",
            "short_description": "A first person psychological horror game created for VR. Have you lost your mind? Or has the world around you gone mad?",
